From: Ozark <ozark@localhost>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:16:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] Phone page: pair, connect and forget phones

A Phone page lists paired phones with connect/disconnect and forget.
'Pair new phone' makes the unit visible for 3 minutes with a countdown;
a BlueZ agent (registered as the default) shows the pairing code to
confirm, and only accepts new devices while pairing mode is on. Newly
paired phones are trusted, and trusted phones are reconnected when Dash
starts, the last one used first.

